cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Duckoder
message: If you use Duckoder in your work, please cite it as below.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Web platform that generates code for teaching boards, such as the ESP32 and the Arduino Uno,
  Mega and Nano, from requests written in Brazilian Portuguese. The code is generated by the
  Claude API or by a language model running locally through Ollama, from a hardware profile that
  describes the board's components and pins.
authors:
